---
/**
 * Control Hub: Standard Operator Plans vs Spenza ControlHub
 *
 * "Spenza" in a heading is the logo wordmark, as on every site page — the
 * same image and class `brandWordmark` (scripts/lib/html-perf.mjs) writes into
 * the mirrored ones, so fonts.css sizes it to the heading's cap height.
 */
---

<section class="sec">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head rv">
      <h2 class="h2"><em class="s">Standard Operator Plans vs</em> <span class="brand-lock"><img class="wp-wordmark" src="/spenza-wordmark.svg" alt="Spenza" width="978" height="187" decoding="async" /> ControlHub</span></h2>
      <p class="lede">Operator plans are built for handsets on monthly cycles. ControlHub is built for businesses that sell connectivity.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cmp rv" role="table" aria-label="Standard operator plans compared with Spenza ControlHub">
      <div class="cmp-r cmp-h" role="row"><div role="columnheader">Capability</div><div role="columnheader">Standard operator plans</div><div class="sp" role="columnheader"><span class="lg" role="img" aria-label="Spenza"></span><span>ControlHub</span></div></div>
      <div class="cmp-r" role="row"><div role="cell">Plan design</div><div role="cell"><span class="lab">Standard operator plans</span>A few fixed tiers built for handsets</div><div class="sp" role="cell"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="10" fill="#ff4904"/><path d="M6 10.2l2.6 2.6L14 7.4" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><span><span class="lab"><span class="lg" role="img" aria-label="Spenza"></span> ControlHub</span>Custom data, voice, and SMS allowances for each device type</span></div></div>
      <div class="cmp-r" role="row"><div role="cell">Billing terms</div><div role="cell"><span class="lab">Standard operator plans</span>One billing model per account</div><div class="sp" role="cell"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="10" fill="#ff4904"/><path d="M6 10.2l2.6 2.6L14 7.4" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><span><span class="lab"><span class="lg" role="img" aria-label="Spenza"></span> ControlHub</span>Prepaid, postpaid, or pay-as-you-go, set per plan and per level</span></div></div>
      <div class="cmp-r" role="row"><div role="cell">Reselling</div><div role="cell"><span class="lab">Standard operator plans</span>Carrier-branded plans only</div><div class="sp" role="cell"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="10" fill="#ff4904"/><path d="M6 10.2l2.6 2.6L14 7.4" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><span><span class="lab"><span class="lg" role="img" aria-label="Spenza"></span> ControlHub</span>Your plans and your prices at every level of your reseller network</span></div></div>
      <div class="cmp-r" role="row"><div role="cell">Billing hierarchy</div><div role="cell"><span class="lab">Standard operator plans</span>A separate account for each customer</div><div class="sp" role="cell"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="10" fill="#ff4904"/><path d="M6 10.2l2.6 2.6L14 7.4" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><span><span class="lab"><span class="lg" role="img" aria-label="Spenza"></span> ControlHub</span>Parent-child billing with markups and payouts tracked in one place</span></div></div>
      <div class="cmp-r" role="row"><div role="cell">Plan changes</div><div role="cell"><span class="lab">Standard operator plans</span>Fixed for the billing cycle</div><div class="sp" role="cell"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="10" fill="#ff4904"/><path d="M6 10.2l2.6 2.6L14 7.4" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><span><span class="lab"><span class="lg" role="img" aria-label="Spenza"></span> ControlHub</span>Automatic step-up to a larger plan when a line runs out</span></div></div>
      <div class="cmp-r" role="row"><div role="cell">Operator choice</div><div role="cell"><span class="lab">Standard operator plans</span>One carrier behind every plan</div><div class="sp" role="cell"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="10" fill="#ff4904"/><path d="M6 10.2l2.6 2.6L14 7.4" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><span><span class="lab"><span class="lg" role="img" aria-label="Spenza"></span> ControlHub</span>Each plan mapped to the best-fit operator plan and pool</span></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
